-- board.talk: part of the verdict-behind-a-fuel-slice case (ADR 0031). Its
-- deciding clause walks a bishop's path square by square, which is more
-- Fuel than one Fuel Slice.

script variable occupied = ["e5", "h8"]
script variable moves = 0

on beforeMove m, deciding
  repeat for each sq in the path of m
    if sq is in occupied then veto "The path is blocked at " & sq & "."
  end repeat
  add 1 to moves
end beforeMove
